Smooth edges arrive: the round Brush, the Line, Rectangle, Ellipse, and Triangle tools, and the round Eraser gain an AA (anti-alias) toggle for crisp, smooth edges. Strokes now lay a single even coat: repainting inside one stroke never darkens it, and lifting to stroke again deepens. The Airbrush's Mist sprays richer specks of varied depth. GIF export now tells you when semi-transparent pixels were flattened. Plus fixes and polish.
